{"id":"f487f6ba96a103ff","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-omega-props.md","title":"Basic Properties of Universal Halting Probabilities","display":"thm-omega-props — Basic Properties of Universal Halting Probabilities","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-omega-props","aliases":["43-thm-omega-props"],"display":"thm-omega-props — Basic Properties of Universal Halting Probabilities","depends_on":["[[43-df-omega]]","[[43-df-leftcomputable]]","[[43-df-mlrandom]]","[[43-df-universal-prefix-machine]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"§8.2; Theorem 9.2.5; Levin–Schnorr equivalence","source_printed_pages":"135; 171","source_pdf_pages":"155; 191","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-omega-props"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-omega-props</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-omega-props — Basic Properties of Universal Halting Probabilities"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2e51855b95e81cff\" href=\"?note=2e51855b95e81cff\" title=\"43-df-omega\">43-df-omega</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e7d00f16a112ff92\" href=\"?note=e7d00f16a112ff92\" title=\"43-df-leftcomputable\">43-df-leftcomputable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f5078ab697e20add\" href=\"?note=f5078ab697e20add\" title=\"43-df-universal-prefix-machine\">43-df-universal-prefix-machine</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§8.2; Theorem 9.2.5; Levin–Schnorr equivalence"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"135; 171"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"155; 191"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UniversalPF}(U)\">\\(\\mathrm{UniversalPF}(U)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega_U\">\\(\\Omega_U\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2e51855b95e81cff\" href=\"?note=2e51855b95e81cff\" title=\"43-df-omega\">43-df-omega</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LeftComputable}\">\\(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{MLRandom}\\)</span> 分别采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e7d00f16a112ff92\" href=\"?note=e7d00f16a112ff92\" title=\"43-df-leftcomputable\">43-df-leftcomputable</a> 的实数谓词与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a> 的序列谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 量化于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\">\\(2^\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"0&lt;\\Omega_U&lt;1\\land\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\Omega_U).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[0&lt;\\Omega_U&lt;1\\land\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\Omega_U).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists X\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(\\Omega_U=\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X(n)2^{-(n+1)}\\land\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists X\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(\\Omega_U=\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X(n)2^{-(n+1)}\\land\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>停止域枚举给出左 c.e. 逼近；随机性由 Omega 不可压缩性。随机实数不是二进有理数，故结合 Kraft 界与正停止质量得到严格位于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(0,1)\">\\((0,1)\\)</span>。显式存在的随机展开绑定了实数与序列，展开唯一性由其非二进有理性保证。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 2007-07-28 草稿，§8.2; Theorem 9.2.5; Levin–Schnorr equivalence；印刷页 135; 171，PDF 页 155; 191。本次逐项核对陈述；来源证明的已读范围见本次审阅账本，未作机器形式验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"2e51855b95e81cff","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-omega]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-leftcomputable","status":"resolved","id":"e7d00f16a112ff92","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-leftcomputable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-mlrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-universal-prefix-machine","status":"resolved","id":"f5078ab697e20add","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-universal-prefix-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"2e51855b95e8